    "text": "\u201cProvided further, a taxable person to whom paragraph (d) applies shall be deemed to have complied with the requirement of registration under this subsection, if such person makes an application for such purpose to the Commissioner-General in the specified form not later than fifteen days from the date of operation of this (Amendment) Act.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
